      "updated": 1781495915260,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "python3 -m virtualenv venv\nsource venv/bin/activate\npip install langgraph\npip install langchain -> langgraph & langchain works together, we are creating workflow using\n    LangGraph but if we need any LLM related component we will get from LangChain.\n    like Chatmodels, prompt templates, document loaders, text splitters we will get from \n    langchain\npip install langchain_openai -> OpenAPI not giving free apikey\npip install langchain-google-genai\npip install dotenv",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "python3 -m virtualenv venv\nsource venv/bin/activate\npip install langgraph\npip install langchain -> langgraph & langchain works together, we are creating workflow using\n    LangGraph but if we need any LLM related component we will get from LangChain.\n    like Chatmodels, prompt templates, document loaders, text splitters we will get from \n    langchain\npip install langchain_openai -> OpenAPI not giving free apikey\npip install langchain-google-genai\npip install dotenv",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
