      "text": "since we are using LangGraph, we will represent this workflow as graph, we need to\ndefine a state as well.\n\nstate ->\n\nheight:\nweight:\nbmi:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
