      "updated": 1781573383211,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "start -> gen_outline -> gen_blog -> end\n\nin both nodes gen_outline and gen_blog we will interact with LLM\n\n\nstate\ntopic : str\noutline : str\nblog content : str\n\ndue to in Langgraph we have concept of state, hence we have access of topic, outline & blog content\nin our last output\nbut in langchain we will not get all,we will just get conent.\n\n\nstart -> gen_outline -> gen_blog -> evaluate_content -> end\nevaluate content will evaluate blog content and provide score and feedback\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "start -> gen_outline -> gen_blog -> end\n\nin both nodes gen_outline and gen_blog we will interact with LLM\n\n\nstate\ntopic : str\noutline : str\nblog content : str\n\ndue to in Langgraph we have concept of state, hence we have access of topic, outline & blog content\nin our last output\nbut in langchain we will not get all,we will just get conent.\n\n\nstart -> gen_outline -> gen_blog -> evaluate_content -> end\nevaluate content will evaluate blog content and provide score and feedback\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
